1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,540
Your moves!

2
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,320
It's time to duel!

3
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:08,377
The four Battle City finalists
are now being transported to

4
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:12,320
the top of the tower for the
first duel of the semi-finals.

5
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,440
Our shadow game awaits.

6
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:17,817
I hope you're prepared to be
swallowed up by the darkness.

7
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,460
Keep dreaming, Psycho.

8
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:25,920
At last, I can defeat
Yugi and reclaim my glory.

9
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:28,737
I have to crush Kaiba to get to Merrick!

10
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:32,114
It's the only way I can save
the world from destruction!

11
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,720
Well, this is it!

12
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:38,980
The duel starts now! Let's go!

13
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,977
Move it or miss it!

14
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:42,197
Hold the door, Mokuba!

15
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,220
Wait for us!

16
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,557
Hold on a sec!

17
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:46,581
We can't just take off like this!

18
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:49,757
Somebody's gotta tell Serenity
her brother's about to duel!

19
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,670
Good point!

20
00:01:50,753 --> 00:01:53,200
So, I'll just go! Bye! Tristan!

21
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,700
This tower's high-tech!

22
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,820
I'll call.

23
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,499
Thanks for letting me know, Mokuba.

24
00:02:00,740 --> 00:02:02,100
But I'll stay here.

25
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:04,717
Someone needs to help keep an eye on mine.

26
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:05,800
You sure? Yep.

27
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,140
Wish Joey luck.

28
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:10,460
Please win.

29
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:16,480
Merrick Ishtar and Joey Wheeler
will face off in five minutes.

30
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:36,260
All right, chump, I'm going
to enjoy taking you apart.

31
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,460
Hey, where's my fan club?

32
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:43,240
Why do you want them here so they
can witness your defeat, you fool?

33
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:46,240
When your mind is engulfed by the shadows,

34
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:49,540
you'll be glad that no
one was here to see it.

35
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,800
This shouldn't take long.

36
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,300
If Joey is defeated by Merrick,

37
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:04,397
he could end up losing more
than just this tournament.

38
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,140
He could lose his mind.

39
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:08,260
Oh, hey, Uke.

40
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:13,057
Joey, this is going to be the most difficult
and dangerous duel you've ever fought.

41
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:14,920
Nah, Merrick's got no chance.

42
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,697
I'm gonna crush that creep.

43
00:03:16,780 --> 00:03:17,757
Just wait and see.

44
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:21,097
He'll be out of this tournament
before he can say freak show.

45
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,010
Hmph.

46
00:03:22,093 --> 00:03:24,717
You couldn't beat Merrick if he
was blindfolded and handcuffed.

47
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,860
I don't remember asking you.

48
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,160
Wake up, Wheeler.

49
00:03:28,460 --> 00:03:30,940
You're no match for his Egyptian god card.

50
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,510
Kaiba!

51
00:03:32,593 --> 00:03:33,477
You may not remember this,

52
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,817
but I went up against Marek's
winged dragon of Ra once before,

53
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:38,840
pal, and I did just fine.

54
00:03:39,060 --> 00:03:43,400
If memory serves me, that Egyptian
god card knocked you out cold.

55
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:45,000
Face it, Wheeler.

56
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:47,338
You don't have what it takes to win.

57
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,957
I'm the only one who can defeat Ra.

58
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:54,880
Ah, Kaiba, the winged dragon of Ra holds
secrets that none of us understand yet.

59
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:55,930
Wrong.

60
00:03:56,013 --> 00:03:58,680
I've uncovered the secrets of Ra. Why?

61
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,740
While you geeks were asleep,

62
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:05,780
my computer was translating the
Egyptian writing that no one else could.

63
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:10,020
Well, why don't you try reading the text?

64
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:15,220
For perhaps you're in need of a lesson in
the ancient Egyptian scriptures, my dear.

65
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:17,117
He's got me trapped.

66
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:21,940
Well, why don't I read the
text and regain control of Ra?

67
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:24,400
Great beast of the sky,

68
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:29,417
please hear my cry Transform
thyself from orb of light

69
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:34,717
And bring me victory in this
fight Unlock your powers

70
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:39,437
from deep within So that
together we may win Appear in

71
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:44,440
this shadow game as I call
your name Winged Dragon of Ra!

72
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,020
Behold, my great beast!

73
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:54,000
Wait, this can't be.

74
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,660
I can read it. You what?

75
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:59,920
That Egyptian text is
completely clear to me.

76
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:03,097
I can read that paragraph as
if it were written in English,

77
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:06,239
but I've never seen that
language before in my life.

78
00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:09,197
Big deal, so your computer
figured it all out.

79
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:11,417
I have a feeling there's
more to it than that.

80
00:05:11,500 --> 00:05:15,920
I bet Kaiba's connection to the
ancient past somehow helped him.

81
00:05:16,820 --> 00:05:17,650
Wheeler,

82
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,697
I'm the only one who can
defeat the winged dragon of Ra,

83
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,297
and you're going to help me.

84
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:23,280
Fat chance.

85
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:25,577
You're the last person I'd ever help.

86
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:27,072
You don't have a choice.

87
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:30,517
I'll be watching your duel
against Maric very closely so

88
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:34,720
I can test my own strategy and
take him down in the finals.

89
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,540
We'll see.

90
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,936
Once I defeat Yugi in the semifinals,

91
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,057
I'll gain ownership of
Slifer the Sky Dragon,

92
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:43,728
giving me two Egyptian
god cards in my deck.

93
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:48,468
Then I'll be ready to face Marek, once
you've served as my lab rat, of course.

94
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,780
I'm no lab rat!

95
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:56,061
The fact that an amateur like you made it
this far in my tournament boggles my mind.

96
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:59,597
But on the bright side, at least
you're serving a purpose wheeler.

97
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:02,157
Watching you lose to
Marek will help me perfect

98
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,900
my plan to crush his winged dragon of Ra.

99
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:07,651
Did I mention you're getting on my nerves?

100
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:11,802
Kaiba, you think you have the rest
of this tournament figured out.

101
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:18,160
But in order for this scheme of yours
to work, you have to get past me first.

102
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,920
He knows it's true, Yook.

103
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,320
We'll soon find out.

104
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:26,000
Our duel is next.

105
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:29,020
But first, Wheeler has a battle to lose.

106
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,000
I hate that guy.

107
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,220
We're here, bro!

108
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:38,160
So, what did we miss, guys?

109
00:06:38,340 --> 00:06:39,577
Yeah, something wrong?

110
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:40,700
I sense tension.

111
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:42,240
Is Kaiba bugging you?

112
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,774
None of your business.

113
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:45,720
Well, excuse us, Sunshine.

114
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,906
Someone's in a cheerful mood.

115
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,460
I gotta keep my cool.

116
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,737
Kaiba's just playing mind games.

117
00:06:52,820 --> 00:06:56,180
I have to ignore him and
focus on taking down Marek.

118
00:06:56,400 --> 00:07:00,047
It'll be tough, but I didn't get
where I am by taking it easy.

119
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:05,105
I crushed some of the strongest duelists
around to get to the Battle City Finals.

120
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:08,560
Besides, this is about more
than just winning a duel.

121
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:12,004
It's about keeping a
promise I made to a friend.

122
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:21,782
It's time to show Merrick that no one messes
with my friends and gets away with it.

123
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:25,420
All right, you're going down, Merrick.

124
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:29,800
The first duel of the
semifinals is about to begin.

125
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:32,780
To my left, Merrick Ishtar.

126
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,840
To my right, Joey Wheeler.

127
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:36,897
That's me!

128
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:38,040
Come on!

129
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:39,200
You can do this!

130
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,780
Quit this, wacko, Joey!

131
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:48,900
There is nothing left
for me to do but wait.

132
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,440
The rest is in the hands of fate.

133
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:57,820
Merrick will begin.

134
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,300
As you wish.

135
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:03,420
I play Gilgarth in attack mode.

136
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:09,260
Then I shall place one card
face down and end my turn.

137
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:11,600
I'll take it from here, you nutcase.

138
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:15,440
I'm off to a bad start.

139
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:19,357
His Gilgoth has 1,800 attack points
and none of my cards can beat it.

140
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,270
Yet.

141
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:23,520
I'll also place one card face down.

142
00:08:23,900 --> 00:08:27,880
And then I'll summon my
alligator sword in defense mode.

143
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:35,180
The time has come to take this
duel to the next level Next level?

144
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:42,640
I know where this is going I was
afraid Merrick would do this Come on,

145
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,080
again? Joey!

146
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:47,640
This duel's now a shadow game

147
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:51,460
Show some originality, Merrick

148
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:58,660
The shadows hunger for your mind
and your soul You don't scare me.

149
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:01,340
Then what's that I see in your eyes?

150
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:03,620
I'd say it's the look of fear.

151
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:07,377
Fear that you're about to join
your friend in the Shadow Realm.

152
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:08,940
Look, she'll be back.

153
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,720
You're so naive.

154
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:12,749
She's permanently trapped.

155
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,657
And with each passing second,

156
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:18,152
another portion of her mind
is absorbed into the darkness.

157
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:23,760
Someone, please, tell us where am I?

158
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:27,120
Can you hear those screams?

159
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:30,146
They're the helpless
cries of your friend Mai.

160
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:33,680
And the weaker she gets,
the stronger my powers grow.

161
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,740
You're nuts.

162
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,377
We can't let Joey go
through with this duel.

163
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:43,297
This is exactly what happened
when Merrick dueled Mai.

164
00:09:43,380 --> 00:09:44,560
It's too dangerous.

165
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,760
Let's step in.

166
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:47,782
Joey's already made up his mind.

167
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,136
Didn't I tell you what he said to me?

168
00:09:50,300 --> 00:09:51,160
What's that?

169
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:52,680
Sorry, Yugi.

170
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:55,592
I should have told you about this before.

171
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:59,460
Joey and I had a conversation
after Mai's duel with Marek.

172
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:04,857
I know if I beat that evil freak
in a duel, I can get Mai back.

173
00:10:04,940 --> 00:10:06,705
Are you sure about this, Joey?

174
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:09,857
I've never been more sure
of anything in my life.

175
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:13,080
I owe it to Mai and to
myself to face Marek.

176
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:17,634
If I back away from this fight now,
I'll never be able to forgive myself.

177
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:19,140
I've made up my mind.

178
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:23,387
I gave Mai my word that I wouldn't
let anything happen to her.

179
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:27,160
And Joey Wheeler would never
break a promise to a friend.

180
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:29,600
So look out, Maric, cause here I come!

181
00:10:30,780 --> 00:10:35,340
So Joey's trying to rescue Mai out
there, and nothing we say can stop him.

182
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:36,540
I thought so.

183
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:39,817
There's gotta be something
we can do to save Joey!

184
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:44,018
I know he promised to bring back
Mai, but there has to be another way!

185
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,300
Yugi, it's his fight.

186
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:50,200
Just as Joey made a promise to Mai,

187
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:54,997
we made a promise to Joey that we
would stop protecting him We must prove

188
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:59,960
to Joey that we believe in him by
letting him duel on his own We can't!

189
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:05,640
Trust him, Yugi He can win, but
he needs our faith and support

190
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,620
Hang in there, Joey!

191
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:09,135
We're all right here!

192
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:15,200
I gotta beat Maric at his own
twisted game or lose my mind trying!

193
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:23,977
so let's do this bring it
on i'm ready for your shadow

194
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:28,537
game do you have any idea what
you're about to experience i

195
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:32,277
doubt it the ancient dark magic
i've conjured will devastate

196
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:37,277
you you poor soul my move you
may have seen the power of the

197
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:41,417
shadows before but as the
energies within me grow so does

198
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:44,557
the strength of my shadow magic
are you here to talk or are

199
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:48,137
you here to duel Aren't you
the least bit curious how this

200
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:51,691
shadow game will differ from
the one that your friend lost?

201
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:52,760
As always,

202
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,497
the loser of the duel will
be banished to the shadow

203
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:59,540
realm for eternity But
there's a bit more Say what?

204
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:05,800
You'll soon find out And then, mark my
words, you'll wish you never faced me

205
00:12:06,540 --> 00:12:10,480
Joey can't let Merrick keep messing
with his head like this Yeah,

206
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:15,445
it's all part of Merrick's warped mind
game Don't let him get to you, Joey Right.

207
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,759
I'm ready to rumble, you big freak.

208
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:20,040
Then let the shadow game begin.

209
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,550
Ready?

210
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,640
What's going on?

211
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:28,937
You mind telling me why this thing
is connecting me to my monster?

212
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:32,138
Didn't I tell you that this
duel was a bit different?

213
00:12:32,260 --> 00:12:37,040
I decided to raise the stakes by adding
these energy streams to our game.

214
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,735
Now, whenever your monster's attacked,

215
00:12:39,980 --> 00:12:44,717
your body will be drained of a little more
energy, leaving you weaker than before.

216
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,060
Just go.

217
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:48,900
With great pleasure, Mr. Wheeler.

218
00:12:49,820 --> 00:12:52,800
I'll summon Drillago in attack mode.

219
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,540
Drillago, attack!

220
00:12:57,500 --> 00:13:01,460
Destroy his alligator
sword and grade his energy!

221
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:07,440
Joey!

222
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:09,780
Stay strong.

223
00:13:11,140 --> 00:13:12,637
That wasn't fun.

224
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:15,440
It's the ultimate test of his strength.

225
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:16,840
Come on, Joey!

226
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:18,920
All right, then.

227
00:13:19,180 --> 00:13:21,057
So this duel's got a little twist.

228
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:23,077
But it can work against you, too.

229
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:27,740
He doesn't realize that my inner
strength is far superior to his.

230
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:31,600
Gilgoth, attack his life points directly!

231
00:13:34,100 --> 00:13:35,220
Joey, no!

232
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:38,820
I reveal my scapegoat
magic card to protect me!

233
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:45,730
What's this?

234
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:51,200
And since my scapegoat's not a monster
card, there's no energy stream to zap me.

235
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,900
Nice move, Joey. Hmm.

236
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:56,442
Well, it looks as though
I've underestimated you.

237
00:13:56,780 --> 00:13:57,662
Make your move.

238
00:13:57,900 --> 00:13:59,920
Oh, I will. Stand back.

239
00:14:00,540 --> 00:14:01,600
Read it and wait.

240
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:06,865
Because now I summon my good buddy, Panther
Warrior, to the field in attack mode.

241
00:14:07,860 --> 00:14:09,937
Ready for a taste of your own medicine?

242
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:14,960
I'll sacrifice one scapegoat to jump-start
my panda and attack your gilgar.

243
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,100
Yeah, baby!

244
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,760
That one was for Mai.

245
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:32,100
Speaking of your friend Mai,
her mind should be empty by now.

246
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:34,241
Your head games won't work on me.

247
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,800
My turn is done.

248
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,760
And so are you.

249
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:40,260
You've had your fun,

250
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:47,100
but now, it's time for me to end all
that with this, my Tribute Burial card!

251
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:48,750
No way!

252
00:14:48,980 --> 00:14:53,897
Now I can bring one monster back from
each of our graveyards and sacrifice them

253
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:58,857
to summon an even stronger creature to
drain whatever's left of your strength,

254
00:14:58,940 --> 00:14:59,770
Wheeler!

255
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:01,180
Alligator Sword!

256
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:08,300
I sacrifice you to summon
this, the mighty Helpoemer.

257
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:17,880
And I can assure you that this new monster
of mine is more than he appears to be.

258
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,237
What does he mean by that?

259
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,517
It's got the same strength
as my Danter Warrior.

260
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,424
Unless it has a hidden ability.

261
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:25,480
I gotta find out, or I'm done.

262
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:33,380
I'll place one card face
down and then end my turn!

263
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,469
Why didn't Merrick attack?

264
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:37,408
He must be up to something!

265
00:15:38,340 --> 00:15:40,520
Time for me to put you in your place!

266
00:15:41,260 --> 00:15:42,520
So, look out!

267
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:45,400
Awesome! It's Jinzo!

268
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:49,524
This bad boy can rearrange his
Hell Poema's face one, two, three!

269
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:50,918
I gotta be careful!

270
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:54,057
He could have blasted my scapegoat
last turn and he held back!

271
00:15:54,140 --> 00:15:56,777
He must want me to attack his Hell Poemora

272
00:15:56,860 --> 00:15:59,389
so he can spring its
special ability on me.

273
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:01,740
I can't risk my Jinzo just yet.

274
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:03,300
It's showtime!

275
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:07,760
I summon Rocket Warrior in Attack Mode!

276
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:09,840
You fool!

277
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:12,200
You fell directly into my trap!

278
00:16:12,620 --> 00:16:14,180
Reveal Face Down card!

279
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:19,420
By summoning a monster in Attack Mode, you
activated my Hidden Soldier's Trap card.

280
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:23,915
This gives me the ability to summon
any monster with four stars or less.

281
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:26,920
Meet my Plasma Eel!

282
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:32,480
Now I'll activate its special
ability, the power of Plasma Grip!

283
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,340
Now for the fun part!

284
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:40,980
When my eel attaches itself to a monster,

285
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:45,840
it lowers that monster's strength,
so your panther loses 500 points!

286
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,900
And according to the
rules of our Shadow Game,

287
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:53,220
as your monster is drained of
its energy, so are you, Wheeler!

288
00:16:58,520 --> 00:16:59,560
Fight it, Joey!

289
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:00,820
Hang in there!

290
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:04,280
Well now, are you beginning
to regret dueling me?

291
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:06,280
I won't give up on you, Mai!

292
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,060
Forget about me! Just go!

293
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:11,100
No way, Mai!

294
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,201
Not without you!

295
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,600
Now, link the dragon on Ra!

296
00:17:15,020 --> 00:17:16,400
Destroy them both!

297
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:18,880
Hang in there!

298
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:21,660
You're gonna be okay, Mai. I promise.

299
00:17:21,980 --> 00:17:24,333
And I never break a promise to a friend.

300
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,920
You'll never break my spirit, Merrick.

301
00:17:29,220 --> 00:17:30,880
I made a promise.

302
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:35,477
That evil creep can drain my
physical strength all he wants,

303
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:37,854
but he'll never drain my determination.

304
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:42,574
I gave Mai my word that I'd rescue
her, and there's no way I'm giving up.

305
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:45,980
What's this?

306
00:17:46,180 --> 00:17:48,415
That fool should be begging for mercy.

307
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,380
You can't keep me down.

308
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:53,197
Not as long as I have
something to fight for.

309
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:56,100
Activate Rocket Warrior's special ability!

310
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:57,880
Invincible mode!

311
00:17:59,220 --> 00:18:01,040
Attack his Hell Poema!

312
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:10,797
Not only did he drain that monster's
strength, he drained Merrick's too!

313
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:11,710
That's right!

314
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:16,220
Next, I'll sacrifice a scapegoat,
letting Panther Warrior strike back!

315
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:17,880
Time to attack now!

316
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,165
Slice and dice his Hell Poema!

317
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,600
Eat that.

318
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:34,040
What's so funny?

319
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:36,200
Thank you, little Joey.

320
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:39,560
By attacking my beast, you
caused your own demise.

321
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:40,880
How's that?

322
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:42,120
It's simple.

323
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:45,277
When you sent my help-o-ever
to the card graveyard,

324
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:48,280
you activated my
monster's special ability.

325
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,017
What's its special ability?

326
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:53,660
Patience, my boy, for
you're about to find out.

327
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:55,448
And I doubt you'll like it.

328
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:57,880
You're caught.

329
00:18:58,080 --> 00:19:00,060
It's in your graveyard now.

330
00:19:00,580 --> 00:19:02,500
It gets much better.

331
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:08,077
Now it can destroy you from within
your own dual disc. I don't get it.

332
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,866
How's it going to destroy me?

333
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:11,700
Yeah. Oh, man.

334
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:15,680
Time for you to learn Help-O-Ever's
special ability. Yeah.

335
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:19,540
Say farewell to a random
card from your hand.

336
00:19:21,580 --> 00:19:23,300
Hey, not that card.

337
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:27,288
Yes, and I'm afraid there's
plenty more where that came from.

338
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:31,048
For as long as my Help-O-Emma
remains in your card graveyard,

339
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:33,840
you'll lose one card every turn. Oh, no!

340
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:37,757
If he keeps losing cards from his
hand, Joey will never beat Merrick.

341
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:41,960
This is even more amusing than my
duel against your friend, mine,

342
00:19:42,220 --> 00:19:46,960
but in the end, I'm afraid your fate
will be exactly the same as hers,

343
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:49,440
an eternity in the Shadow Realm.

344
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:51,740
Ha, ha, ha!
